Return AppResult<T> from commands. Register commands and update CommandMap and mirrored models together. Keep mutex guards out of async I/O. Never put credentials in frontend code or disable CSP. Run cargo fmt --check, cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings, and cargo test using src-tauri/Cargo.toml.
